 technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":2191},{"name":"tessa-tapmongkol/tindog","owner":"tessa-tapmongkol","html_url":"https://github.com/tessa-tapmongkol/tindog","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2191},{"name":"ericmaino/gradle-plugins","owner":"ericmaino","html_url":"https://github.com/ericmaino/gradle-plugins","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"A scratch pad for gradle utilities","topics":[],"score":2191},{"name":"ru14/portfolio","owner":"ru14","html_url":"https://github.com/ru14/portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"portfolio","topics":[],"score":2191},{"name":"KendraBlalock/Dual-Language","owner":"KendraBlalock","html_url":"https://github.com/KendraBlalock/Dual-Language","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2191},{"name":"leondz/greennlp","owner":"leondz","html_url":"https://github.com/leondz/greennlp","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2191},{"name":"gragollier/EECS-731-Project-2","owner":"gragollier","html_url":"https://github.com/gragollier/EECS-731-Project-2","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2191},{"name":"chiarng/pineapplecake-cli","owner":"chiarng","html_url":"https://github.com/chiarng/pineapplecake-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"pineapplecake-cli","topics":[],"score":2191},{"name":"chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","owner"